  "content": "<html><body>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\">創造的樂趣：客廳關卡</span></p> \n <p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1233592915721191536/1244924645195513856/fsger.png?ex=6656e1ec&amp;is=6655906c&amp;hm=d40e736505556d5c1916411805e35ec4a026c0fdf254293c67f2249aa61276f3&amp;=\" alt=\"fsger.png\" width=\"\" height=\"\"></p> \n <p>&nbsp;</p> \n <p><strong>貢獻者:</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/a_exploding/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">All Exploding - builder</a></p> \n <p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/seamuskills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">seamuskills - 程序員</a></p> \n <p><strong><u>不要在多人遊戲中運行！此模式將破壞地圖！”&lt;/em&gt;</u></strong></p> \n <p>請在下方評論反饋或錯誤問題，我們會盡快聯繫您！<br></p> \n <p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這張地圖片段類似於《Joy of Creation》中的客廳記憶片段。<br/>它包含了四個機械人的功能，以及一個可暫停Foxy和Freddy的相機系統。<br/>當你失敗的夜晚後會有一個基本的跳嚇機制。</span></p> \n <p><br></p> \n <p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此外，它有三種模式，在完成前一種模式後解鎖：</span><br><strong style=\"color:#000\">Classic</strong><br><strong style=\"color:#e74c3c\">Nightmare</strong><br><strong style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Endless<br></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Endless模式包括里程碑進度，你可以在早上6點、9點和11點嘗試達成這些目標！<br></span></p> \n <p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你能夠撐到早上六點嗎？<br></span></p> \n <p><img src=\"https://imagedelivery.net/W9K_l6ndK9x4x8m3rurakg/ce2727bb-1a58-43a1-f54b-80fc2a09db00/original\" alt=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\"></p> \n <p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976658853724827648/1244891129149652992/image.png?ex=6656c2b6&amp;is=66557136&amp;hm=991e9885be3353d609a35a15827c924ea684bc5397a0502e87fc0ab83595b785&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\"></p> \n <p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976658853724827648/1244891176457469952/image.png?ex=6656c2c1&amp;is=66557141&amp;hm=614fc4627841c923c3acb1b2943a11f912ea6f142aa91c437d1b6b7f9abac10d&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\"></p> \n</body></html>",
